shit started for me one way...

239
00:11:05.916 --> 00:11:07.626
but it's endin' up different.

240
00:11:08.919 --> 00:11:11.838
I got feelings for you. Jarita.
That's the truth.

241
00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:15.592
But I also got a business
that's bumping up against

242
