Agent Tanner.

288
00:13:15.337 --> 00:13:16.922
I'm tight with the kid's mother.

289
00:13:17.672 --> 00:13:19.382
And I owe her
some sort of closure.

290
00:13:19.549 --> 00:13:21.343
even if it isn't a conviction.

291
00:13:27.682 --> 00:13:30.143
You worked closely
with Malcolm Howard.

292
00:13:33.063 --> 00:13:34.564
