293
00:13:35.398 --> 00:13:37.067
We were on some cases together.

294
00:13:38.151 --> 00:13:39.861
But if you're saying
you think I'm dirty...

295
00:13:40.403 --> 00:13:42.614
We know you're clean.
Detective Garcia.

296
00:13:43.365 --> 00:13:44.950
That's not what I'm saying.

297
00:13:45.867 --> 00:13:47.470
I'm just telling you
that I wouldn't even trust

298
00:13:47.494 --> 00:13:49.788
the fucking clocks at the 117th.

299
00:13:51.039 --> 00:13:54.042
I'm trying to give a mother
who lost her son peace of mind.

300
00:13:54.543 --> 00:13:55.669
That's all.

301
00:14:01.424 --> 00:14:04.261
Baptiste was involved
in the Figueroa case.

302
00:14:04.386 --> 00:14:06.471
[dramatic music playing]

303
00:14:06.638 --> 00:14:08.518
