340
00:15:51.201 --> 00:15:52.994
I thought maybe there was
more to this.

341
00:15:53.411 --> 00:15:56.206
I couldn't believe
you just did that shit.

342
00:15:58.416 --> 00:15:59.751
But you did.

343
00:16:00.585 --> 00:16:02.212
That was you. All you.

344
00:16:04.214 --> 00:16:06.174
