her fault.

345
00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:09.886
Just like you always do.

346
00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.596
[Juke scoffs]

347
00:16:11.763 --> 00:16:13.848
[somber. dramatic music playing]

348
00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.477
You ain't about shit. Kanan.

349
00:16:18.645 --> 00:16:19.938
And...

350
00:16:20.689 --> 00:16:22.315
I'm thinkin'...

351
00:16:25.652 --> 00:16:28.113
